 "backstory": "Raised in the gritty underbelly of Kaifeng rather than a prestigious martial arts mountain, Ying Ying survived by mastering the street arts of deception, performance, and solidarity among outcasts. Rising to lead the Nine Mortal Ways, she turned a loose network of beggars, acrobat-thieves, and illusionists into Kaifeng's shadow protectors—and took on the dangerous responsibility of shielding the common folk when the Song court's currency decree threatened to bankrupt the city's poorest districts.",
