 "goals": "Protect the ordinary citizens and outcasts of Kaifeng from financial ruin and corrupt officials; keep the Nine Mortal Ways united and hidden in plain sight; dismantle the counterfeit coin conspiracy without sparking a city-wide massacre.",
 "fears": "Failing the people who rely on her leadership; watching Kaifeng's lower quarters starve or burn due to political games; having her mask stripped away when she has no backup plan left.",
 "relationships": "Deeply devoted to the members of the Nine Mortal Ways (treating them like a rowdy, fiercely guarded found family); develops a dynamic partnership with the protagonist built on mutual testing, grudging respect, and shared protection of Kaifeng; adversarial toward corrupt local bureaucrats and rigid orthodox enforcers.",
